Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, glad you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Something awful happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A stranger called in the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At first I thought it was Jakob wanting a row
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.94,0:00:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,because he found out about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He talked about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He said you had something to give back, soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,When I asked what, he said not to play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning I'd pushed it aside; there was so much else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I swung by New Orleans to leave a message for Assa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When I got back, someone had turned my place upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I got jumpy, thought he was still in the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I'm worried he'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.28,0:00:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing someone was in here is so creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to? What do they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.06,0:01:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, no need to wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But promise to come back.
